  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What crosses the boundary",
      "items": [
        "Facts from README, manifest, code and tests, each tied to the file it came from",
        "From configuration only variable names, purposes and defaults; never a value from .env"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What stops at it",
      "items": [
        "Secrets: hard rule 7 plus a grep for key-shaped strings before the report",
        "Anything a page would load at open time: no fetch, XHR, CDN, web font or analytics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What nothing enforces",
      "items": [
        "Every control is an instruction to the agent or a check it runs on itself",
        "Once docs/ is published, access control is the repository's or the host's"
      ]
